    <div class="ds-eyebrow ac">GAMES OF CHANCE</div>
    <h2 class="ds-h2"><span class="ds-ic" aria-hidden="true">🎰</span> The casino</h2>
    <p class="lead">Pepe runs the tables in the pads' chat rooms and shows the action on stream. Each game runs in one room;
      Pepe tells you where to head if you type a command somewhere else.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3><span class="ds-ic" aria-hidden="true">🎡</span> Wheel of Misfortune</h3>
        <p>5,000 PAT a spin, on the site or in chat. Where it stops is what you win. The thin gold slice is the
          jackpot: it hits about 1 in 3,000 spins and pays a share of the House, the casino jackpot (up to 5M).</p>
        <p>The gold wheel on your profile allows <strong>100 spins a day plus 25 per level</strong> (level 10: 350), resetting at
          midnight UTC. <strong>+100 Daily Gold Spins</strong> in the <a href="/shop">shop</a> adds 100 a day for good: 3M PAT for
