          soft 17. Double, split (up to 4 hands), insurance. Bets 100 to 10,000 PAT, up to 6 players.</p>
        <div class="cmd"><code>!bj start</code> · <code>!bet 500</code> · <code>!hit</code> / <code>!stand</code> · <code>!autobet</code></div>
